{"id":"parce","lemma":"parce","pos":"prep","rank":102,"glosses":["because (parce que)"],"ipa":"/paʁs/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f9/Fr-parce.ogg/Fr-parce.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"C'est parce que je vous aime.","en":"It's because I love you.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"that / what"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,7,"I love you"]]},{"text":"Je le fais parce que je le dois.","en":"I do it because I have to.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},null,{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"}]},{"text":"Je mange parce que j'ai faim.","en":"I eat because I'm hungry.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to eat","l":"manger"},null,{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"hunger"}]},{"text":"Je suis heureux, parce que vous êtes ici.","en":"I'm happy because you're here.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"happy"},null,{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Je déteste le monde parce que le monde me déteste.","en":"I hate the world because the world hates me.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hate, to detest","l":"détester"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"world"},null,{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"world"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to hate, to detest","l":"détester"}]}]}